    "summary_one_sentence": "A thrilling tropical vacation turns into a claustrophobic nightmare when a group of college friends becomes trapped in a flooded Thai cave system with a deadly predator and dwindling oxygen.",
    "summary_short": "What begins as an exciting Thailand vacation quickly transforms into a fight for life when a group of college friends explores a remote cave network. After a sudden surge of water traps them inside the submerged caverns, they discover they are not alone in the dark waters. As their oxygen supply steadily depletes, hidden personal conflicts and betrayals surface among the group. Trapped between a relentless aquatic predator and rising waters, they must face both internal fractures and external terror to escape.",
    "summary_long": "Seeking an unforgettable thrill during their trip to Thailand, a group of college friends decides to venture into an off-grid cave network. Excited for adventure, they dive into the subterranean passages, but an unexpected storm causes swift flash floods that seal their exit. Cut off from the surface, the friends navigate through dark, narrow chambers while their oxygen reserves rapidly diminish. Their panic escalates when they realize a lethal aquatic predator is stalking them through the murky subterranean waters. As claustrophobia sets in, long-buried grievances and secret betrayals surface, causing fierce arguments among the friends. Trust completely shatters when desperate choices about survival force each person to prioritize their own life over others. With their air running dangerously low and the monster closing in, the survivors are pushed to their ultimate physical and psychological limits. They must devise a perilous plan to navigate the flooded tunnels and defeat the threat before the cave becomes their permanent tomb.",
    "synopsis": "'The Devil's Mouth' is an intense horror-thriller that merges survival drama with aquatic creature terror. Set against the breathtaking yet treacherous landscapes of Thailand, the story follows a close-knit group of college friends whose dream holiday collapses into disaster during an illicit cave-diving expedition. Trapped deep within a flooded underground cave system, the group finds themselves stripped of all modern lifelines as oxygen levels plummet and floodwaters rise. The narrative balances high-stakes physical survival against an ancient predator that hunts within the submerged dark with a tense character study of friendship under extreme pressure. As secrets come to light and panic takes hold, 'The Devil's Mouth' explores how far individuals will go to survive when hunted by both nature and their own pasts.",
